Question 4: How many total hours have been spent watching the five seasons of Stranger Things?
To get the total viewing hours of the five seasons of Stranger Things, I exclude any related spin-offs. This allows us to focus on viewership of the main series.


Show Code
total_strange_hours&lt;-NETFLIX_DATA|&gt;
  filter(str_detect(title,"Stranger Things"))|&gt;
  filter_out(str_detect(title,"Beyond"))|&gt;
  filter_out(str_detect(title,"Fireplace"))|&gt;
  filter_out(str_detect(title,"Tales"))|&gt;
  summarise(total_hours=comma(sum(hours_viewed,na.rm=TRUE)))|&gt;
  pull(total_hours)


Across the seven periods, we get that a total of 5,548,500,000 hours has been spent watching the five seasons of Stranger Things.


